&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;Additional information, including&nbsp;the signed decision record, is available at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;the &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW24002932 BCX0" href="https://eplanning.blm.gov/eplanning-ui/project/2025844/510" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;BLM National NEPA Register&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(33, 37, 41); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;. For more information, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;please contact BLM Public Affairs Specialist Larisa Bogardus at &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;541-523-1407 or &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a class="Hyperlink SCXW24002932 BCX0" href="mailto:lbogardus@blm.gov" rel="noreferrer noopener" style="margin: 0px; padding: 0px; user-select: text; -webkit-user-drag: none; -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent; text-decoration-line: none;" target="_blank"&gt;&lt;span style="color:rgb(0, 0, 255); font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;lbogardus@blm.gov&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family:roboto,roboto_embeddedfont,roboto_msfontservice,sans-serif; font-size:12pt"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
